{"title":"2025 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Azizi sold chocolate bars from Monday to Friday over three weeks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>During the first week, he sold the following numbers of chocolate bars:\n</p><p>(Add a table: Monday = 15, Tuesday = 23, Wednesday = 18, Thursday = 15, Friday = 7)\n</p><p>How many chocolate bars did he sell in total during the first week?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can simply add all of the chocolate bars together:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/0/140e32c06b4ec6c6be710b3b236f664e4ace0523.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 + 23 + 18 + 15 + 7 = 38 + 33 + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"287\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/7/2d7ea4a79f1575f8a7aa26d3a65e7722861a1380.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=38 + 40 = \\boxed{78}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"133\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018031913\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.013 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 16/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 143/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 398/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.940      1 2025_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1\n100.00%    5.940      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35021:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018031913 and revision id 271996. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}